* "American 5153" preamp, stage 2 of 3: channel THREE (RED), the other input stage (driven by the guitar too): V1A, the THREE GAIN pot R11, V4A, V4B, V5A, V5B, V6A
* and V6B (a cathode follower) and its tone stack and THREE VOLUME. As the drawing (0070922000); the muting JFET Q1 / Q11 and the clamp zeners Z1 / Z2 are not modelled.

V VRAIL x 100 341
R R95 x w 10k
C C36 w 0 22u
C C40 x 0 47u

* The guitar (the same source as stage 1's, with its pickup / cable networks).
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p
R RIN in 0 1M

* V1A: R47 10k / R49 1M / C22 39p, R48 68k on the grid; plate R82 220k, cathode R33 1.8k with C17 1u. C16 (470p) into the THREE GAIN pot R11 (1M) with C15 .001 across
* it and R28 / R29 1M, then R61 470k and R62 10k into V4A.
R R47 in a47 10k
R R49 a47 0 1M
C C22 a47 0 39p
R R48 a47 g1a 68k
T V1A g1a p1a k1a 12AX7
R R82 w p1a 220k
R R33 k1a 0 1.8k
C C17 k1a 0 1u
C C16 p1a n16 470p
R R28 n16 0 1M
R VR11T n16 w11 1
R VR11B w11 0 1
C C15 n16 w11 1n
R R29 w11 0 1M
R R61 w11 q1 470k
R R62 q1 g4a 10k

