* V6A (R71 1M in, R72 1M + C37 .022u from its plate, R73 1M), R74 560k / R75 220k / R76 330k with C31 .22u into V6B, the cathode follower.
C C28 p5b n28 22n
R R71 n28 g6a 1M
R R73 g6a 0 1M
R R72 g6a f72 1M
